  "$comment": "Creatures. Hitboxes in sprite-local design px at scale 1.0 (near plane); the sim scales by plane. Speeds in design px per second at the mid plane (speeds.run is the only run-speed source). A 'hit' is one shot landing >= min(pelletsToBag, weapon.pellets) pellets; bosses lose armorHits first, then need hitsToBag hits. How many of each non-target appear per hunt is set by the biome's events, not here.",
